    "created_at": "2016-03-21T09:46:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-21T09:46:20Z",
    "body": "It might use the same algorithm for loading images (but with `srcset` etc disabled) and share the document image cache, and so on. But I haven't looked at `image` implementations so I'm mostly guessing.\n",
