    "updated_at": "2016-03-21T22:16:59Z",
    "body": "The SVG _wants_ to support `srcset` (and `<picture>`), tho.  And SVG2 is setting non-XLink attributes on all its linking elements; it's _possible_ that we can harmonize the attr names with HTML on the corresponding elements.\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
