    "created_at": "2016-03-22T16:01:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-22T16:01:38Z",
    "body": "No, they'd be in the HTML namespace, [same as audio/video/iframe/canvas](https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/embedded.html#HTMLElements).\n\n(I actually didn't realize we'd updated the spec to switch over to using the HTML elements; I thought it was still theoretical/planned.  I'll open a separate bug about modifying the SVG part of the parser to put those in the right namespace automatically.)\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
