    "updated_at": "2016-03-23T21:40:30Z",
    "body": "It has some aspect-ratio stuff. _Mostly_ that's handled by object-position and object-fit, but there's some stuff where it seems like it takes information from the nearest `<svg>` container which we can't match.  Think that's it, tho.\n",
